    "e jagate! e tattbera śuna bibaraṇa",
    "parabrahma sanātana, ānandasbarūpa",
    "nityakāla rasa[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]rūpa, rasera ādhāra—",
    "parātpara, adbitīya, ananta, apāra",
    "tathāpi sbarūpatattba, śakti[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]śaktimān,",
    "līlārasa[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]parākāṣṭhā, āśraya[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]sbarūpa",
    "tarka ki se[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]tattba kabhu sparśibāre pāre ?",
    "rasatattba sugambhīra! samādhi[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]āśraye",
    "upalabdha! āhā mari, samādhi ki dhana!!",
    "samādhistha ha’ye dekha, susthira antare,",
    "he sādhaka! rasatattba akhaṇḍa ānanda,",
    "kintu tāhe āsbādaka[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]āsbādya[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]bidhāna,",
    "nityadharma anusyūta! adbitīya prabhu,",
    "āsbādaka kṛṣṇarūpa,—āsbādya rādhikā,",
    "dbaitānanda! parānanda[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]pīṭha bṛndābana!",
    "prākṛta jagate yā̃’ra prakāśa[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]biśeṣa,",
    "yogamāyā prakāśitā! tā̃hāra āśraye",
    "labhiche sādhakabṛnda nitya prematattba—",
    "ādarśa, yāhāra nāma bikuṇṭha[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]kalyāṇa !!",
    "yadi yāha nityānanda[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]prabāha sebite",
    "abirata, gurupādāśraya kara’ jība!",
    "nirasa bhajana samudaya parihari’—",
    "brahma[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]cintā ādi yata, sadā sādha’ rati,",
    "kusumita bṛndābane śrīrāsamaṇḍale",
    "puruṣatba[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]ahaṅkāra nitānta durbala",
    "taba  tumi śuddha jība  āsbādya sbajana,",
    "śrīrādhāra nityasakhī! parānandarasa",
    "anubhabi’! māyābhoga tomāra patana!!",
    "(śrīla bhaktibinoda ṭhākura)"
