      "apūrba baiṣṇaba-tattba! ātmāra ānanda-",
      "prasrabaṇa! nāhi yā’ra tulanā saṁsāre",
      "sbadharma baliyā yā’ra āche paricaya",
      "e jagate! e tattbera śuna bibaraṇa",
      "parabrahma sanātana, ānandasbarūpa",
      "nityakāla rasa-rūpa, rasera ādhāra—",
      "parātpara, adbitīya, ananta, apāra",
      "tathāpi sbarūpatattba, śakti-śaktimān,",
      "līlārasa-parākāṣṭhā, āśraya-sbarūpa",
      "tarka ki se-tattba kabhu sparśibāre pāre ?",
      "rasatattba sugambhīra! samādhi-āśraye",
      "upalabdha! āhā mari, samādhi ki dhana!!",
      "samādhistha ha’ye dekha, susthira antare,",
      "he sādhaka! rasatattba akhaṇḍa ānanda,",
      "kintu tāhe āsbādaka-āsbādya-bidhāna,",
      "nityadharma anusyūta! adbitīya prabhu,",
      "āsbādaka kṛṣṇarūpa,—āsbādya rādhikā,",
      "dbaitānanda! parānanda-pīṭha bṛndābana!",
      "prākṛta jagate yā̃’ra prakāśa-biśeṣa,",
      "yogamāyā prakāśitā! tā̃hāra āśraye",
      "labhiche sādhakabṛnda nitya prematattba—",
      "ādarśa, yāhāra nāma bikuṇṭha-kalyāṇa !!",
      "yadi yāha nityānanda-prabāha sebite",
      "abirata, gurupādāśraya kara’ jība!",
      "nirasa bhajana samudaya parihari’—",
      "brahma-cintā ādi yata, sadā sādha’ rati,",
      "kusumita bṛndābane śrīrāsamaṇḍale",
      "puruṣatba-ahaṅkāra nitānta durbala",
      "taba  tumi śuddha jība  āsbādya sbajana,",
      "śrīrādhāra nityasakhī! parānandarasa",
      "anubhabi’! māyābhoga tomāra patana!!",
      "(śrīla bhaktibinoda ṭhākura)"
     ]
